### REACT-WebFashion API Test Collection
### Base URL: http://localhost:5001/api

### ============================================
### 1. AUTH ENDPOINTS (Public)
### ============================================

### 1.1 Sign Up
POST http://localhost:5001/api/auth/signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@gmail.com",
  "passWord": "Password123",
  "firstName": "Nguyen",
  "lastName": "Van A",
  "userName": "testuser123"
}

### 1.2 Send OTP
POST http://localhost:5001/api/auth/sendOTP
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@gmail.com"
}

### 1.3 Verify OTP
POST http://localhost:5001/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@gmail.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 1.4 Sign In
POST http://localhost:5001/api/auth/signIn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "testuser123",
  "passWord": "Password123"
}

### 1.5 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:5001/api/auth/resetPassword
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@gmail.com",
  "otp": "123456",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123"
}

### 1.6 Sign Out
POST http://localhost:5001/api/auth/signOut
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: refreshToken=your_refresh_token_here

{}

### ============================================
### 2. CATEGORY ENDPOINTS (Public)
### ============================================

### 2.1 Get All Categories
GET http://localhost:5001/api/categories

### 2.2 Get Category By ID
GET http://localhost:5001/api/categories/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

### 2.3 Create Category (Admin)
POST http://localhost:5001/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "name": "Áo",
  "description": "Áo thời trang nữ"
}

### 2.4 Update Category (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/categories/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "name": "Áo Nữ",
  "description": "Áo thời trang dành cho nữ"
}

### 2.5 Delete Category (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/categories/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### ============================================
### 3. PRODUCT ENDPOINTS (Public)
### ============================================

### 3.1 Get All Products
GET http://localhost:5001/api/products

### 3.2 Get Product By Slug
GET http://localhost:5001/api/products/ao-thoi-trang-nu-dep

### 3.3 Create Product (Admin)
POST http://localhost:5001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "name": "Áo Thời Trang Nữ",
  "slug": "ao-thoi-trang-nu",
  "categoryId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
  "description": "Áo thời trang cao cấp cho nữ",
  "price": 299000,
  "image": "https://example.com/image.jpg"
}

### 3.4 Update Product (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/products/507f1f77bcf86cd799439012
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "name": "Áo Thời Trang Nữ Cao Cấp",
  "price": 349000,
  "description": "Áo thời trang cao cấp cho nữ - Chất liệu tốt"
}

### 3.5 Delete Product (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/products/507f1f77bcf86cd799439012
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### ============================================
### 4. PRODUCT ITEMS ENDPOINTS (Public)
### ============================================

### 4.1 Get All Product Items
GET http://localhost:5001/api/product_items

### 4.2 Get Product Item By ID
GET http://localhost:5001/api/product_items/507f1f77bcf86cd799439013

### 4.3 Create Product Item (Admin)
POST http://localhost:5001/api/product_items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "productId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439012",
  "size": "M",
  "color": "Đỏ",
  "quantity": 50,
  "price": 299000
}

### 4.4 Update Product Item (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/product_items/507f1f77bcf86cd799439013
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "quantity": 100,
  "price": 279000
}

### 4.5 Delete Product Item (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/product_items/507f1f77bcf86cd799439013
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### ============================================
### 5. CART ENDPOINTS (Private - Require Auth)
### ============================================

### 5.1 Get Cart
GET http://localhost:5001/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### 5.2 Add to Cart
POST http://localhost:5001/api/cart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "productItemId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439013",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 5.3 Update Cart Item
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/cart/507f1f77bcf86cd799439014
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### 5.4 Delete Cart Item
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/cart/507f1f77bcf86cd799439014
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### ============================================
### 6. CART ITEMS ENDPOINTS (Private - Require Auth)
### ============================================

### 6.1 Get All Cart Items
GET http://localhost:5001/api/cart_items
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### 6.2 Get Cart Item By ID
GET http://localhost:5001/api/cart_items/507f1f77bcf86cd799439014
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### 6.3 Create Cart Item
POST http://localhost:5001/api/cart_items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "cartId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439010",
  "productItemId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439013",
  "quantity": 3
}

### 6.4 Update Cart Item
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/cart_items/507f1f77bcf86cd799439014
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "quantity": 2
}

### 6.5 Delete Cart Item
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/cart_items/507f1f77bcf86cd799439014
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### ============================================
### 7. ORDER ENDPOINTS (Private - Require Auth)
### ============================================

### 7.1 Get Orders By User
GET http://localhost:5001/api/order/507f1f77bcf86cd799439001
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### 7.2 Create Order
POST http://localhost:5001/api/order
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "userId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439001",
  "cartId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439010",
  "totalPrice": 598000,
  "status": "pending",
  "shippingAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue, Ha Noi"
}

### 7.3 Update Order
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/order/507f1f77bcf86cd799439015
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "status": "shipped"
}

### 7.4 Delete Order
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/order/507f1f77bcf86cd799439015
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### ============================================
### 8. ORDER ITEMS ENDPOINTS (Private - Require Auth)
### ============================================

### 8.1 Get All Order Items
GET http://localhost:5001/api/order_items
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### 8.2 Get Order Item By ID
GET http://localhost:5001/api/order_items/507f1f77bcf86cd799439016
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### 8.3 Create Order Item
POST http://localhost:5001/api/order_items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "orderId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439015",
  "productItemId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439013",
  "quantity": 2,
  "price": 299000
}

### 8.4 Update Order Item
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/order_items/507f1f77bcf86cd799439016
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "quantity": 3,
  "price": 279000
}

### 8.5 Delete Order Item
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/order_items/507f1f77bcf86cd799439016
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### ============================================
### 9. USER ENDPOINTS (Private - Require Auth)
### ============================================

### 9.1 Get Current User (Me)
GET http://localhost:5001/api/user/me
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

### 9.2 Update Profile
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/user/updateProfile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "avatar_url": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg",
  "address": [
    {
      "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
      "phone": "0912345678",
      "city": "Ha Noi",
      "district": "Ba Dinh",
      "detail": "123 Nguyen Hue Street"
    }
  ]
}

### 9.3 Update Password
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/user/updatePassword
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer your_access_token_here

{
  "currentPassword": "Password123",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123",
  "confirmPassword": "NewPassword123"
}

### ============================================
### NOTES:
### ============================================
### 1. Replace "your_access_token_here" with actual JWT token from sign in
### 2. Replace "507f1f77bcf86cd799439001" with actual MongoDB ObjectIds
### 3. Private routes require Authorization header with Bearer token
### 4. Use REST Client extension in VS Code to run these requests
### 5. Setup .env file with correct MongoDB URI and EMAIL credentials
